 gonna  introduce something very very exciting  we just basically cracked the solution  for we instant cash withdrawal from  several big exchanges and we're gonna  showcase how it works we have we're  gonna have a press conference and and  and we'll share the information with our  community but this is something very big  that we're very excited to showcase next  week would you say that the Orca  platform is geared primarily towards  managing crypto with the connection to  Fiat bank account or do you see it as  sort of both a crypto and fiat platform  equally it's designed for cryptocurrency  users of course we focus mainly on  cryptocurrency users but also you know  for those who use fiat and maybe one  turn through cryptocurrency world this  is a good gate to the crypto world but  mainly yes the answer would be we are  designing this platform for  cryptocurrency community last thing I  want to touch on so of course you're  focusing significantly on sort of like  making it simpler to have higher user  adoption in the crypto space other than  just user adoption what do you think is  the sort of another make-or-break sort  of element for crypto is it perceived  security is it solving some of the you  know resource issues that  exist with the mining of some crypto  currencies like Bitcoin like aside from  just how many people are using it what  else do you believe will be make or  break for the crypto world I believe  it's regulation this is something that  you know there is a clear lack of  regulation and governments and  regulators they do not really as we see  it now they don't understand how it  works and they're trying to do some of  the government's aren't letting just go  and and in in looking where it leads the  community and and and and then will try  to regulate that some governments just  ban it and then see we know the examples  perfectly and then just look trying to  figure out what to do with the criminal  activity that is happening because of  the ban but yeah we we believe that  regulation I personally believe that  regulation is a big thing and we're  looking forward towards a smart  regulation and we are actually talking a  lot with regulators trying to help them  educating them by educating them and you  know it's all about sharing the  information and and helping the  regulators the government's to figure  out how to use crypto how to track  crypto how to avoid criminal decrypt and  if you when this is going to be solved  we'll see a mass adoption of perfect  super interesting project we've been  speaking with Netanyahu dan who's the  founder and CEO of Orca you can find out  more using the links in the video  description 'not on thanks so much for  talking to us about this thanks for  having

